        11 passed in 1183.07 s; the five-row chamber test 554.82 s, the
        strengthened two-lifts test 234.91 s, and the fourth cusp's walk test
        11 walls at 0020 decompositions -- all green.
      tests/lattices/test_the_integral_lift_locus_is_a_union_of_transvection_cosets.sage
